{
  "_about": [
    "Seed images for PostPix (P37). Maps each seed user's avatar and each seed post's image to an S3 key under seed/.",
    "With MEDIA_BASE_URL set, the app uses MEDIA_BASE_URL + '/' + key; without it (local development) it uses 'source', the original hot-linked URL.",
    "The infra repo builds the media pack from this file: download every 'source', upload it to the uploads bucket at 'key' with the right Content-Type.",
    "Seed numbers match the #N comments in users.py and postN variables in posts.py. Keys never change once uploaded (CDN caches them for a year)."
  ],
